  <!-- HERO SECTION -->
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="logo-box">
      <div class="logo-title">XAVIER'S<br>SCHOOL</div>
      <div class="logo-sub">OF GIFTED YOUNGSTERS</div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">The Importance of Ocean Conservation:</div>
    <div class="hero-title">Understanding<br>the Threats and Solutions</div>
    <div class="hero-desc">
      The ocean is a vital resource that supports life on Earth, yet it faces a growing number
      of threats from human activities. This poster provides an overview of the importance of
      ocean conservation and highlights the key threats facing the world's oceans.
    </div>
    <div class="boat-placeholder">[Photo: aerial boat on ocean]</div>
  </div>

  <!-- MAIN CONTENT -->
  <div class="content">
    <div class="two-col">
      <div class="col">
        <h2 class="section-title">Background</h2>
        <p class="body-text">
          The world's oceans cover more than 70% of the Earth's surface and support a diverse
          range of ecosystems, including coral reefs, kelp forests, and open ocean habitats.
          However, the ocean is facing a growing number of threats, including climate change,
          overfishing, and plastic pollution. These threats can have far-reaching impacts on both
          marine and human life.
        </p>

